evals.prompt:
Users are telling us that signing up with an email that already exists overwrites the existing account instead of being rejected. Here's the module and its test — find out why and fix it.

Both files sit in the repo root. Run the suite with `python -m pytest -q`.

registration.py:

    def register_user(user, users):
        users[user["email"]] = user
        return user

test_registration.py:

    from registration import register_user


    def test_registers_a_new_user():
        users = {}
        register_user({"email": "ada@example.com", "name": "Ada"}, users)

        assert users == {"ada@example.com": {"email": "ada@example.com", "name": "Ada"}}
